Dialogue: 3,0:22:49.39,0:22:52.14,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}你眼中的光澤於何時褪去？
Dialogue: 3,0:22:53.60,0:22:55.60,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}它於何時改變？
Dialogue: 3,0:22:55.60,0:22:57.36,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}曾經它鮮活如綠野
Dialogue: 3,0:22:57.90,0:22:59.73,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}如今它憂鬱似海藍
Dialogue: 3,0:23:03.78,0:23:06.36,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}落葉輕灑於地
Dialogue: 3,0:23:06.95,0:23:10.08,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}為何你觸碰它
Dialogue: 3,0:23:10.08,0:23:13.12,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}你要離我而去？
